<section style="padding:3rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border)"><div style="max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 1.5rem"><h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2rem);font-weight:600;color:var(--color-text);margin-bottom:1.5rem">Why Partner with SDF Clothing?</h2><p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem">Uniform programs are built for consistency across repeat orders — the same fabric lot, color, and construction on a reorder placed a year later as on the original — which is easier to hold when production stays with one factory rather than shifting between subcontractors as volume changes. GOTS, OEKO-TEX Standard 100, BSCI, WRAP, and ISO 9001 certification applies.</p><p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem">Uniform fabric is typically tested for wash-cycle durability given how frequently uniforms get laundered compared to regular apparel, and embroidered logo placement is standardized across a size range so branding sits consistently regardless of garment size. Minimum order is 300 pieces per style, with fabric sourcing, embroidery, bulk manufacturing, and export documentation included.</p><p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem">Organizations ordering uniforms at scale feel Bangladesh's trade position directly in per-unit cost: a 20% cap on US tariffs from late 2025, and continued EU duty-free access under Everything But Arms through November 2029 despite this year's LDC graduation.</p><p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:2rem">Ready to start? <a href="/contact/" style="color:var(--color-primary)">Request a sample</a> or <a href="/contact/" style="color:var(--color-primary)">contact our team</a> for a detailed FOB quote within 48 hours.</p></div></section>
